# Preview screenshots for the M1 preview gate (ML-029): the integrated app over a fixture store
# of two fictional accounts, the store-backed list with a message selected, and the reader
# showing it through the app's own store, at the design mock's three widths. Three fictional
# messages dated today and yesterday go on top, so the list shows the mock's sections.
# matte-black (dark, square corners as on stock Omarchy) and catppuccin-latte (light, corners
# rounded 8 as on this desktop) are swapped into the run's scratch Omarchy state; the desktop's
# own theme is never read or changed. The sleeps give the reader's web view time to lay the
# message out. Not part of tools/ci.sh; it writes into tools/progress/public/. Run from the
# repository root:
#   cargo build -p sealwax -p sealwax-fixtures
#   tools/headless.sh 33 target/debug/sealwax --self-test tests/selftest/preview-m1-gate.sealwax-test

desktop tiling
fixtures --count 1200 --seed 7 --now now --folders spread --account Personal
fixtures --count 300 --seed 8 --now now --folders spread --account Work
theme matte-black
corners 0
resize 1440 900
list-wait
mail-add Personal:inbox yesterday "Saturday ride: route and coffee stop" "from=Fjord Cycling Club" "text=We meet at 09:00 by the fountain. 62 km, mostly flat, coffee in Drøbak at the halfway point." read starred
mail-add Personal:inbox 3h "Re: Quarterly report draft" "from=Marius Dahl" "text=Looks good. Two small comments on page 4: the churn chart uses last year's scale, and the summary could lead with the support numbers." read attachment
mail-add Personal:inbox 1h "Cabin weekend — final plan" "from=Ingrid Solberg" "text=Hi! I've booked the cabin in Hemsedal for the 17th to the 19th. It sleeps six, has a sauna, and the key is in the box by the door."
list-select 1
sleep 1500
assert-layout wide
screenshot $DIR/../../tools/progress/public/m1-gate-wide-matte-black-square-2026-10-04.png
resize 1100 900
sleep 800
assert-layout rail
screenshot $DIR/../../tools/progress/public/m1-gate-rail-matte-black-square-2026-10-04.png
resize 800 900
sleep 800
assert-layout narrow
screenshot $DIR/../../tools/progress/public/m1-gate-narrow-matte-black-square-2026-10-04.png

theme catppuccin-latte
corners 8
resize 1440 900
list-select 4
sleep 1500
assert-layout wide
screenshot $DIR/../../tools/progress/public/m1-gate-wide-catppuccin-latte-rounded-2026-10-04.png
resize 1100 900
sleep 800
assert-layout rail
screenshot $DIR/../../tools/progress/public/m1-gate-rail-catppuccin-latte-rounded-2026-10-04.png
